# The spine's receipts, candidates and evidence are versioned on purpose: a
# receipt nobody can re-derive is paperwork. Objects stay ignored — they are
# compiler output, reproducible from the candidate once the pinned toolchain
# exists, and they are the only large/blobby part of the tree.
decomp/objects/*

